      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "TOMMY TIME (2) could only finish seventh at Bathurst most recently but should find this easier and is well served by this barrier. Should get every chance from there. NIFTY AMBITION (4) finished fourth last start, beaten 21 metres at West Wyalong over 1740m. Beautifully placed and is sure to play a major role. ACE OF REASON (1) drew wide last start and was never a genuine threat, beaten 5 metres into sixth at this track over 1770m. Likely to get all the favours from this better draw. Meets a similar quality field and is good enough to put himself in the winners' stall. EYEDIDNTLOSEIT (7) is heading the right way, improving last time out to finish second at Goulburn. Genuine threat.",
